{"unit_id": "Srelka__dsh-ultracode#feature-1", "repo": "Srelka/dsh-ultracode", "commit": "89777a903e5357269b031079f01444239e4dee47", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Ultracode 的功能「多代理工作流」：主代理可通过工作流脚本分阶段派发代理并设置数量上限，执行以后台任务运行。脚本可从文件读取，也支持内联内容。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["workflow.js:327-360", "workflow.js:344-460"]}
